<section class="c">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="What the rate covers" data-de="Leistungsumfang">What the rate covers</p>
  <div class="inout">
    <div>
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:12px" data-en="Included in the rate" data-de="In der Rate enthalten">Included in the rate</h3>
      <ul class="yes">
        <li data-en="Receiving at the collection point in Kampala" data-de="Annahme an der Sammelstelle in Kampala">Receiving at the collection point in Kampala</li>
        <li data-en="Bagging and export marking" data-de="Absacken und Markierung">Bagging and export marking</li>
        <li data-en="Export under the licence of a licensed exporter" data-de="Export unter der Lizenz eines zugelassenen Exporteurs">Export under the licence of a licensed exporter</li>
        <li data-en="Land transport to Mombasa" data-de="Landtransport bis Mombasa">Land transport to Mombasa</li>
        <li data-en="Sea freight to Hamburg" data-de="Seefracht bis Hamburg">Sea freight to Hamburg</li>
        <li data-en="Import clearance" data-de="Einfuhrabfertigung">Import clearance</li>
        <li data-en="Warehousing in Hamburg" data-de="Einlagerung in Hamburg">Warehousing in Hamburg</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:12px" data-en="Not included" data-de="Nicht enthalten">Not included</h3>
      <ul class="no">
        <li data-en="Uganda cess: 2% of the registered value, at cost" data-de="Uganda Cess: 2 % auf den eingetragenen Wert, zu Beleg">Uganda cess: 2% of the registered value, at cost</li>
        <li data-en="Storage beyond the free period, at cost" data-de="Lagerung über die Freiperiode hinaus, zu Beleg">Storage beyond the free period, at cost</li>
        <li data-en="Insurance, at cost" data-de="Versicherung, zu Beleg">Insurance, at cost</li>
        <li data-en="Our share: way A commission, way B EUR 0.40 per kg plus 50/50 above the registered value (see above)" data-de="Unser Anteil: bei Weg A die Provision, bei Weg B 0,40 € je kg und 50/50 über dem eingetragenen Wert (siehe oben)">Our share: way A commission, way B EUR 0.40 per kg plus 50/50 above the registered value (see above)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="c">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Why this exists" data-de="Warum es das gibt">Why this exists</p>
  <div class="cols">
    <div>
      <h3 data-en="A container is too big for one farm" data-de="Ein Container ist zu groß für eine Farm">A container is too big for one farm</h3>
      <p class="lead sm" data-en="Small volumes from 10 bags travel in a shared container together with other farms." data-de="Kleine Mengen ab 10 Sack fahren im Sammelcontainer mit anderen Farmen mit.">Small volumes from 10 bags travel in a shared container together with other farms.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 data-en="Your name stays on the coffee" data-de="Euer Name bleibt am Kaffee">Your name stays on the coffee</h3>
      <p class="lead sm" data-en="Roasters buy a named lot from a named farm, not anonymous stock." data-de="Röstereien kaufen ein benanntes Lot von einer benannten Farm, keine anonyme Ware.">Roasters buy a named lot from a named farm, not anonymous stock.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 data-en="One rate, everything listed" data-de="Eine Rate, alles aufgelistet">One rate, everything listed</h3>
      <p class="lead sm" data-en="What the rate covers and what it does not is listed below, item by item." data-de="Was in der Rate steckt und was nicht, steht unten, Punkt für Punkt.">What the rate covers and what it does not is listed below, item by item.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Terms" data-de="Bedingungen">Terms</p>
  <div class="terms">
    <p data-en="&lt;b&gt;Minimum&lt;/b&gt; 10 bags of 60 kg." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Mindestmenge&lt;/b&gt; 10 Sack à 60 kg."><b>Minimum</b> 10 bags of 60 kg.</p>
    <p data-en="&lt;b&gt;Plot coordinates&lt;/b&gt; (GPS point or polygon) for every plot are required. Without them nothing is loaded (EU Deforestation Regulation)." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Geodaten jeder Parzelle&lt;/b&gt; (GPS-Punkt oder Polygon) sind Voraussetzung, ohne sie wird nicht verladen (EU-Entwaldungsverordnung)."><b>Plot coordinates</b> (GPS point or polygon) for every plot are required. Without them nothing is loaded (EU Deforestation Regulation).</p>
    <p data-en="&lt;b&gt;The rate per kg&lt;/b&gt; is confirmed in writing before anything is due." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Die Rate je kg&lt;/b&gt; wird schriftlich bestätigt, bevor etwas fällig wird."><b>The rate per kg</b> is confirmed in writing before anything is due.</p>
    <p data-en="&lt;b&gt;Way A&lt;/b&gt; 30% of the rate at booking, the rest before release in Hamburg." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Weg A&lt;/b&gt; 30 % der Rate bei Buchung, Rest vor Freigabe in Hamburg."><b>Way A</b> 30% of the rate at booking, the rest before release in Hamburg.</p>
    <p data-en="&lt;b&gt;Way B&lt;/b&gt; rate, cess, storage, insurance and EUR 0.40 per kg are deducted from the proceeds; above the registered value we share 50/50." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Weg B&lt;/b&gt; Rate, Cess, Lager, Versicherung und 0,40 € je kg werden vom Erlös abgezogen; über dem eingetragenen Wert teilen wir 50/50."><b>Way B</b> rate, cess, storage, insurance and EUR 0.40 per kg are deducted from the proceeds; above the registered value we share 50/50.</p>
    <p data-en="&lt;b&gt;Payments&lt;/b&gt; only to the registered owner, never to agents." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Zahlungen&lt;/b&gt; nur an den eingetragenen Eigentümer, nie an Vertreter."><b>Payments</b> only to the registered owner, never to agents.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="form">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Get in touch" data-de="Kontakt">Get in touch</p>
  <h2 data-en="Tell us about yourselves" data-de="Erzählt uns von euch">Tell us about yourselves</h2>
  <p class="lead" data-en="No obligation. We reply within two working days." data-de="Unverbindlich. Antwort binnen zwei Werktagen.">No obligation. We reply within two working days.</p>

  <form id="direct-trade" name="direct-trade" method="POST" action="/direct-trade-thanks/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
    <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="direct-trade">
    <input type="hidden" name="lang" value="en">
    <p class="hp"><label>Leave empty: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="f"><label for="farm" data-en="Farm / group" data-de="Farm / Gruppe">Farm / group</label><input id="farm" name="farm" required></div>
      <div class="f"><label for="region" data-en="District" data-de="Distrikt">District</label><input id="region" name="region" required></div>
      <div class="f"><label for="contact" data-en="Contact name" data-de="Ansprechperson">Contact name</label><input id="contact" name="contact" required></div>
      <div class="f"><label for="phone" data-en="WhatsApp / phone" data-de="WhatsApp / Telefon">WhatsApp / phone</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required></div>
      <div class="f"><label for="email" data-en="Email" data-de="E-Mail">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email"></div>
      <div class="f full"><label for="about" data-en="Who are you? How long have you grown coffee, how many families are part of it, what matters to you?" data-de="Wer seid ihr? Seit wann baut ihr Kaffee an, wie viele Familien gehören dazu, was ist euch wichtig?">Who are you? How long have you grown coffee, how many families are part of it, what matters to you?</label><textarea id="about" name="about" rows="5"></textarea></div>
      <div class="f full"><label for="coffees" data-en="Which coffees do you have? Varieties, processing, roughly how many bags per season." data-de="Welche Kaffees habt ihr? Sorten, Aufbereitung, ungefähr wie viele Sack pro Saison.">Which coffees do you have? Varieties, processing, roughly how many bags per season.</label><textarea id="coffees" name="coffees" rows="4"></textarea></div>
      <div class="f full"><label for="de_contact" data-en="Family member or partner in Germany (name, email), optional" data-de="Familienmitglied oder Partner in Deutschland (Name, E-Mail), optional">Family member or partner in Germany (name, email), optional</label><input id="de_contact" name="de_contact"></div>
      <div class="f full"><label for="notes" data-en="Notes" data-de="Anmerkungen">Notes</label><textarea id="notes" name="notes" rows="3"></textarea></div>
    </div>
    <p class="note" data-en="By sending you agree that we store your details to answer you. See the &lt;a href=&quot;/datenschutz/&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt; (German)." data-de="Mit dem Absenden stimmt ihr zu, dass wir eure Angaben speichern, um zu antworten. Siehe &lt;a href=&quot;/datenschutz/&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt;.">By sending you agree that we store your details to answer you. See the <a href="/datenschutz/">privacy policy</a> (German).</p>
    <button type="submit" class="send" data-en="Send" data-de="Absenden">Send</button>
  </form>
</section>

